{
  "title": "Dreamscape Odyssey: Against All Odds",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Dreamscape Odyssey: Against All Odds</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Main_Quests\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Main Quests\">Main</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"chapter\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Event</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Somnium_Labyrinth\" title=\"Somnium Labyrinth\">Somnium Labyrinth</a><br /><b>Chapter</b><br /><a href=\"/wiki/When_the_Night_Knocks\" title=\"When the Night Knocks\">When the Night Knocks</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"prev\">Previous Quest</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next Quest</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"prev\"><a href=\"/wiki/When_the_Night_Knocks\" title=\"When the Night Knocks\">When the Night Knocks</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dreamscape_Odyssey:_The_Mountain_and_Six_Credits\" title=\"Dreamscape Odyssey: The Mountain and Six Credits\">Dreamscape Odyssey: The Mountain and Six Credits</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCharacters\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"characters\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Illusia\" title=\"Illusia\">Illusia</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Lumi\" title=\"Lumi\">Lumi</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rover\" title=\"Rover\">Rover</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Tangtang\" title=\"Tangtang\">Tangtang</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Steps\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Steps</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps\">Steps</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li>Approach the giant black cat?</li>\n<li>Talk to the Illusia</li>\n<li>Enter the gateway</li>\n<li>Investigate the dumpster</li>\n<li>Investigate the pile of crates</li>\n<li>Continue forward</li>\n<li>Talk to the strange white cat</li>\n<li>Continue forward</li>\n<li>Defeat the enemies</li>\n<li>Enter the gateway</li>\n<li>Defeat the enemies standing in your way</li>\n<li>Talk to the strange white cat</li>\n<li>Enter the gateway</li>\n<li>Investigate the dumpster</li>\n<li>Enter the gateway</li>\n<li>Investigate the pile of crates</li>\n<li>Enter the gateway</li>\n<li>Get out of here</li>\n<li>Run!</li>\n<li>Talk to the strange white cat</li>\n<li>Defeat the enemies</li>\n<li>Enter the Gate</li>\n<li>(Optional) Talk to Lumi</li></ol>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dt>(Enter the gateway)</dt>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> Nobody's here, just this cat. What's going on...</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Head to the designated location)</dt>\n<dd><b>???:</b> Just know that even the great Rover cannot stop me now!</dd>\n<dd><b>A moon with an ethereal brightness, a pond glimmering beneath the night sky, and a massive shadow lurking in the darkness...</b></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><b>In an instant, it feels as if every memory has slipped away, like a fleeting nightmare.</b></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><b>You sense that you've traveled back to the moment you first stepped through the gateway.</b></dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Talk to the Illusia)</dt>\n<dd><b>Illusia:</b> ...</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Oh, hello there.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Thought this place was empty.</dd>\n<dd><b>Illusia:</b> It's you... you've returned.</dd>\n<dd><b>Illusia:</b> Here, countless dreams rush in...</dd>\n<dd><b>Illusia:</b> These dreams... I no longer wish to have them, to remember anything.</dd>\n<dd><b>Illusia:</b> But I do remember things about you...</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dd><b>Illusia:</b> You're the only one who can restore everything to its rightful place. That's what he said to me.</dd>\n<dd><b>Illusia:</b> Farewell, Dreamwalker. May your thoughts remain unclouded.</dd>\n<dd><b>Illusia:</b> ...</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Enter the gateway)</dt>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> What is this? I've never seen this in the Somnoire before.</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> I should look around for more information.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Investigate the dumpster)</dt>\n<dd><big><b>▇▇livery▇▇list</b></big><hr />Se▇▇der: ▇▇▇▇<br />Recipie▇▇: Tianhu<br />Packag▇▇Category: ▇▇▇▇<br />▇▇▇▇Insurance: Insured<br />Ad▇▇ress: Cruising Drake<br />Recorder: Fulei</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dd><b>Rover:</b> (This is... a delivery checklist. The name signed here is \"Fulei.\")</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> (The rest is smudged. Someone must have lost it here.)</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Head to the designated location)</dt>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> (Some kind of fragment lodged between those rocks. Something from a delivery crate?)</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> (This is probably where Fulei lost the package, but where is it now...)</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Talk to the strange white cat)</dt>\n<dd><b>Strange White Cat:</b> Meow—</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Head to the designated location)</dt>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> (Is that... Lumi? The Tacet Discords are after her!)</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Enter the gateway)</dt>\n<dd><b>Lumi:</b> Find the missing package...</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Lumi?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Hey? You okay?</dd>\n<dd><b>Lumi:</b> Make sure she gets back safely... help with the express order...</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Are you alright?</dd>\n<dd><b>Lumi:</b> Organize a welcome party for the new recruits...</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Lumi? Can you hear me?</dd>\n<dd><b>Lumi:</b> Work finished... Best get movin'. Too many tasks, too little time.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dd><b>Rover:</b> Why can't she hear me?</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> No, she's in danger!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Talk to the strange white cat)</dt>\n<dd><b>Strange White Cat:</b> Meow—</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Enter the gateway)</dt>\n<dd><b>Earlier, over on Lumi's side...</b></dd>\n<dd><b>Lumi:</b> Fulei said the package was lost nearby... Hmm, where is it?</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Investigate the dumpster)</dt>\n<dd><big><b>Deli▇▇Check▇▇</b></big><hr />Send▇▇:Insula<br />Reci▇▇:▇▇▇▇<br />Package▇▇▇▇: Fake Reality<br />Escape▇▇▇▇: Dreamscape<br />Address: Som▇▇ire<br />Recorder: Fulei</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dd><b>Lumi:</b> Oh! It's his delivery checklist!</dd>\n<dd><b>Lumi:</b> The paper's all smudged, can't read a thing...</dd>\n<dd><b>Lumi:</b> This fragment is from the delivery container... Ugh, where's the package? What if it's been damaged...</dd>\n<dd><b>Lumi:</b> Where could it be? Hopefully, I'll find a clue ahead.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Investigate the pile of crates)</dt>\n<dd><b>Lumi:</b> Nothing here...</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Enter the gateway)</dt>\n<dd><b>Lumi:</b> Ah! Where did those Tacet Discords come from?</dd>\n<dd><b>Lumi:</b> Can't waste my time with them...</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Escape from the enemies)</dt>\n<dd><b>Lumi:</b> Phew... made it out at last. But why did those monsters stop chasing me?</dd>\n<dd><b>Lumi:</b> Ugh, I keep getting sidetracked. Focus, Lumi! Think about what you're gonna do next.</dd>\n<dd><b>Lumi:</b> First, find the missing package...</dd>\n<dd><b>Lumi:</b> Second, make sure <a href=\"/wiki/Tangtang\" title=\"Tangtang\">Tangtang</a> gets back safely and help with the express order...</dd>\n<dd><b>Lumi:</b> Third, organize a welcome party for the new recruits... get my own work finished...</dd>\n<dd><b>Lumi:</b> Gest get movin'. Too many tasks, too little time.</dd>\n<dd><b>Lumi:</b> I'm their leader. Got to act the part. They're counting on me...</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Talk to the strange white cat)</dt>\n<dd><b>Strange White Cat:</b> Meow—</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Enter the Gate)</dt>\n<dd><b>Lumi:</b> This must be where Tangtang crashed... I need to find her first, Fulei's package can wait.</dd>\n<dd><b>Lumi:</b> Why are there Tacet Discords here? Where is Tangtang? Is she...</dd>\n<dt>(During the fight)</dt>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> Lumi! Thank goodness you're safe!</dd>\n<dd><b>Lumi:</b> Rover!</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> Let's deal with it first and go find Tangtang.</dd>\n<dd><b>Lumi:</b> Let's do it!!!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Enter the Gate)</dt>\n<dd><b>Tangtang:</b> You're here, Lumi! I've been looking for you!</dd>\n<dd><b>Lumi:</b> Looking for me? I should be the one saying that. I heard you had an accident...</dd>\n<dd><b>Tangtang:</b> A small scratch, no biggie.</dd>\n<dd><b>Tangtang:</b> I was worried you might run into a Tacet Discord. so I came looking for you.</dd>\n<dd><b>Lumi:</b> Thanks. I'm fine. Lem me help you with the delivery.</dd>\n<dd><b>Tangtang:</b> It's okay. The address is around here somewhere. It won't take long.</dd>\n<dd><b>Lumi:</b> But you're hurt. You relax and let me handle it, alright?</dd>\n<dd><b>Tangtang:</b> I can manage, really. You have your own tasks to do. I ca even help you later when I'm done!</dd>\n<dd><b>Lumi:</b> It's my job to look out for you... That's what a team leader should do.</dd>\n<dd><b>Tangtang:</b> I know, and you've been doing great. I just want to lighten the load.</dd>\n<dd><b>Lumi:</b> Aww, Tangtang...</dd>\n<dd><b>Tangtang:</b> Don't worry! I'll catch up with you after I finish this order!</dd>\n<dd><b>Lumi:</b> Okay!</dd>\n<dd><b>Lumi:</b> Thank you, Tangtang. I mean it.</dd>\n<dd><b>Lumi:</b> And you, Rover...</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Leave the Somnoire)</dt>\n<dt>(Quest returns to <a href=\"/wiki/When_the_Night_Knocks\" title=\"When the Night Knocks\">When the Night Knocks</a>)</dt></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table alternating-colors-table\"><tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji EN Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji EN Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_EN_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/f5/Emoji_EN_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-wid